### for every new call
### get the service document

http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService

### get the service document
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/$metadata

### get the employee set
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet

### get the employee set - $count
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count

### get single employee data - by key
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet(ID='02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C197C7FB')

### pagination - load chunk by chunk
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$top=2&$skip=2

### GET with filtering - $filter --- > simple filter
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=BANKNAME eq 'My Bank of San Francisco'

### GET with filtering - $filter --- > pattern search LIKE
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=contains(NAME_FIRST,'Su')

### GET with filtering - $filter --- > lamda function
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet

### GET single Purchase Order - $filter --- > lamda function
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C1979000

### GET single Purchase Order  Items- $filter --- > lamda function
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C1979000?$expand=ITEMS

### GET single Purchase Order and Items
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet?$expand=ITEMS

### GET single Purchase Order - $filter --- > lamda function - all or any(filter item property)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet?$expand=ITEMS&$filter=ITEMS/all(wa:wa/GROSS_AMOUNT gt 1200)

### GET single Purchase Order - $filter --- > lamda function - all or any(filter item property)
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/PurchaseOrderSet?$expand=ITEMS&$filter=ITEMS/any(wa:wa/GROSS_AMOUNT gt 1200)


### Create the employee set 
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Content-Type: application/json

    {
  
      "NAME_FIRST": "Sudha",
      "NAME_MIDDLE": null,
      "NAME_LAST": "CHOUDHURY",
      "NAME_INITIALS": null,
      "SEX": "F",
      "LANGUAGE": "E",
      "PHONE_NUMBER": "+1 224 374 524",
      "EMAIL": "sally.spring@itelo.info",
      "LOGINNAME": "SPRINGS",
      "CURRENCY_code": "USD",
      "SALARYAMOUNT": "1000000.00",
      "ACCOUNTNUMBER": "111222333",
      "BANKID": "510000655",
      "BANKNAME": "NAB",
      "COUNTRY": null
    }

